## Requirements

- [Devbox](https://www.jetify.com/devbox) for support tools (just, pnpm, Postgres, Terraform…).
- Node (version in `.node-version`, e.g. via `fnm`).
{%- if backend == 'go' %}
- Go (version in `apps/api/go.mod`).
{%- else %}
- Rust via `rustup` (version in `apps/api/rust-toolchain.toml`).
{%- endif %}
- Xcode / Android Studio for native development builds.

## Getting started

```bash
devbox shell
just setup        # install, generate, start local Postgres
just dev-api      # API on http://localhost:8080
just dev-app      # Expo dev server
just verify       # everything CI runs
```

Run `just` to list every recipe.

